<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-RIETUMU BANK FIVE-MO PROFIT 3.8 MLN LATS.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-RIETUMU BANK FIVE-MO PROFIT 3.8 MLN LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rietumu Bank on Friday said its profit after five months of the year was 3.824 million lats, of which 738,000 lats came in May.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that its assets rose to 107.08 million lats, an increase of 7.97 million lats, by the end of last month.</p>
<p>The bank's own capital rose from 12.21 million lats to 12.95 million lats, it added.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
